### Get Jira suggestions for autosuggest
# Requires Jira integration to be configured in tock.yaml:
# jira:
#   url: "https://your-domain.atlassian.net"
#   username: "your-email@example.com"
#   api_token: "your-api-token"

### Search for issues containing "backend"
GET http://localhost:8080/jira/suggest?q=posp
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Search for issues with specific key pattern
GET http://localhost:8080/jira/suggest?q=PROJ
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Search with custom limit
GET http://localhost:8080/jira/suggest?q=api&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Example response:
# {
#   "query": "backend",
#   "suggestions": [
#     {
#       "key": "BACKEND-123",
#       "summary": "Implement user authentication"
#     },
#     {
#       "key": "BACKEND-124",
#       "summary": "Add API rate limiting"
#     },
#     {
#       "key": "BACKEND-125",
#       "summary": "Fix database connection pool"
#     }
#   ]
# }

###

### Error: Query too short (less than 2 characters)
GET http://localhost:8080/jira/suggest?q=a
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Error: Missing query parameter
GET http://localhost:8080/jira/suggest
Content-Type: application/json
